{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>ואולם בעבור זאת העמדתיך.</b> The meaning of זאת: for the sake of showing you My power. Similarly, ומתוכה כעין החשמל מתוך האש (Ezekiel 1:4). Yefet said בעבור זאת refers to this plague, namely the plague of hail." "The sense of ולמען ספר שמי is not that it returns to Pharaoh; rather, ספר שם is the verb form, like כי כבד אכבדך (Numbers 22:17). The meaning is not that Pharaoh will roam the world to proclaim the glory of the Name, but that His name will be recounted in every generation because of these signs that He performed."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:57.386229340Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}